    "authEnv": "GRAPH_API_KEY",
    "_note": "The QuickSwap-subgraph repo only deploys to the decommissioned hosted service (`sameepsi/quickswap`, see package.json deploy scripts) — there is no decentralized-network subgraph id in the repo or docs available offline. Replace TODO with the gateway URL of the QuickSwap V2 (Polygon) exchange subgraph: https://gateway.thegraph.com/api/subgraphs/id/<ID> (look it up on https://thegraph.com/explorer by searching 'quickswap' on Polygon; verify the deployment matches commit 47acf76 before use). The schema graft base (QmPUb1rWhd9C81XfiGTSEH3koXikC1bUZaUdMm84957aFv @ block 31025550) means a fresh-from-genesis local index will diverge from any grafted hosted deployment for entities mutated before the graft block; pick a validation block range AFTER 31025550 for a fair comparison if comparing against the grafted deployment."
  },
  "local": { "url": "http://localhost:8080/v1/graphql", "adminSecret": "testing" },
